					21, 6, 14, § 27</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A precious stone of a violet color</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37,
				10, 61, § 170</span></i>.</div>
